{"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InstanceRegistry","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileInstanceRegistry","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryInstanceRegistry","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RegisteredInstance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/AppAttestService","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeviceAppAttestService","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/AppAttestKeyLostError","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderRefusedError"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/httpwalletprovider"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"HttpWalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The installation registers once, at its first Wallet Attestation:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"over a ","type":"text"},{"code":"registration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" challenge, it makes a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"registration key","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key store of its own (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/registrationKeyStore()"},{"text":") and an App Attest","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key, has Apple attest the App Attest key over the client data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"naming the registration key, registers both (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/v1\/instances"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and keeps the instance ID and the two keys’ IDs in its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InstanceRegistry"},{"text":". The registration key signs every later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet-Provider-Request"},{"text":"); no attestation names it. If","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the registration, its key or the App Attest key is lost, the next","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Wallet Attestation registers again, with new keys. An App Attest","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key a registration made but couldn’t register — App Attest’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"server or the provider unavailable, or no connection — is kept, in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this process, and tried again by the next registration, as Apple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asks; it’s dropped when the provider or App Attest refuses it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/walletAttestation(clientID:instanceKey:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" asks for a Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Attestation for the instance key ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"instance_key"},{"text":"). The first time,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it sends an App Attest assertion over a fresh ","type":"text"},{"code":"instance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" challenge","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the key, which the provider records the key with; once it has,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the key alone — and the assertion again if the provider no longer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has its record (","type":"text"},{"code":"evidence_required","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/keyAttestation(instanceKey:keys:nonce:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" asks for a Key"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation over the holder keys, with one assertion over a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"holder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" challenge and all of them, for the issuance of its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance key, which a Wallet Attestation recorded.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"App Attest attests the app, not the wallet’s keys: the provider","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"learns that a genuine copy of the app on a genuine Apple device asked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for them, not where they are. Make them in the Secure Enclave all the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore"},{"text":"‘s default). Where App Attest isn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supported — the Simulator, some older devices — the wallet can’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"register, and every attestation fails as ","type":"text"},{"code":".platform","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": there’s no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unattested path, in development either. A development build (the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.apple.developer.devicecheck.appattest-environment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entitlement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"set to ","type":"text"},{"code":"development","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") makes development-environment keys, which only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a provider configured for them accepts.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Assertions are made one at a time, each sent before the next is made,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as the provider accepts only an assertion whose counter exceeds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"last it took, and the installation registers once. Every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HttpWalletProvider"},{"text":" over the same ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileInstanceRegistry"},{"text":" file (or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryInstanceRegistry"},{"text":") in the process shares that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order, so a wallet rebuilt mid-issuance with a new provider is still","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"serialised with the old one. Over a registry of its own type, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider serialises only its own calls: keep one provider for it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It sends nothing but to its base URL, over https, following no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect, with its timeout for each request, and reads at most"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"256 KiB of an answer. It checks a Wallet Attestation is for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client and the instance key, and a Key Attestation is over the nonce"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sent and attests only keys sent; their signatures are the issuer’s to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verify."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Failures reach the wallet as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletError"},{"type":"text","text":"s: one the network or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider’s availability caused (no connection, a timeout, HTTP 5xx or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"429, a challenge that expired before it was used, App Attest’s server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unavailable) as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".network"},{"type":"text","text":", which may be retried"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderUnavailableError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"); a refusal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderRefusedError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"type":"text","text":", its message naming the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protocol’s error code. On "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"instance_revoked"},{"text":", it forgets the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"registration and deletes its registration key: the next Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Attestation registers the installation again. The revoked instance’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"instance keys stay its own ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"instance_key_registered"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential whose refresh needs one must be received again. On"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"instance_not_active"},{"type":"text","text":" (suspended) it keeps the registration: tell the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"holder, as the provider may resume it. A signed request refused as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid_signed_request"},{"text":" isn’t retried: check the device’s clock, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that the provider still knows the instance.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HttpWalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"HttpWalletProvider","roleHeading":"Class","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"externalID":"s:12OID4VCWallet18HttpWalletProviderC","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HttpWalletProvider"}]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/init(baseURL:instances:registrationKeys:appAttest:timeout:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/keyAttestation(instanceKey:keys:nonce:)","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/sweepOrphanedRegistrationKeys()","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/walletAttestation(clientID:instanceKey:)"]},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/defaultTimeout","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/registrationKeyTagPrefix"]},{"anchor":"Type-Methods","title":"Type Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/registrationKeyStore()"],"generated":true}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" over the Wallet Provider HTTP protocol, version"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"1, that OID4VCgo’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"walletprovider.Provider.Handler"},{"type":"text","text":" serves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo\/blob\/main\/mobile\/WALLET_PROVIDER.md"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with Apple App Attest ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"apple-app-attest"},{"type":"text","text":") as its evidence:"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/InstanceRegistry":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InstanceRegistry","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"InstanceRegistry","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"InstanceRegistry","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/instanceregistry","abstract":[{"text":"Where ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider"},{"text":" keeps the wallet’s registration, so the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"installation registers once, across launches. An instance ID isn’t a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"secret — every request naming it is signed with the registration key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— but losing it loses the instance: the wallet then registers again,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a new registration key and App Attest key, and the instance keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the lost instance recorded can’t be attested again.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileInstanceRegistry"},{"text":" keeps it in a file;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryInstanceRegistry","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is for tests. Over either, every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" in the process registering or asserting for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same registration takes turns; over a registry of another type,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a provider takes turns only with itself: keep one provider for it.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"InstanceRegistry","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}],"title":"KeychainKeyStore","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after ","type":"text"},{"code":"Options.tagPrefix","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProviderRefusedError":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletProviderRefusedError","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"WalletProviderRefusedError","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderRefusedError","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletproviderrefusederror","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletProviderRefusedError","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Wallet Provider refused a request with one of the protocol’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"errors, or answered other than the protocol documents (a redirect, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path it doesn’t serve). It reaches the wallet as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"type":"text","text":", its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message naming "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderRefusedError\/error","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/sweeporphanedkeys(in:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sweepOrphanedKeys","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16KeychainKeyStoreC","text":"KeychainKeyStore"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"type":"topic","title":"sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Deletes every key in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" that none of the wallet’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials is bound to — left by an issuance the app quit or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"crashed in the middle of — and returns how many. Call it at launch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before any issuance or refresh: one in progress holds keys of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletProvider"}],"title":"WalletProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WalletProvider"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/RegisteredInstance":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet’s registration with a Wallet Provider: its registration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key, its App Attest key and the instance ID the provider gave for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them (WALLET_PROVIDER.md, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/v1\/instances"},{"type":"text","text":"). One per installation."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RegisteredInstance"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RegisteredInstance","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RegisteredInstance"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/registeredinstance","kind":"symbol","title":"RegisteredInstance"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/HttpWalletProvider/keyAttestation(instanceKey:keys:nonce:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"keyAttestation"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"instanceKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Data"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"keys","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"nonce"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"type":"topic","title":"keyAttestation(instanceKey:keys:nonce:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/keyAttestation(instanceKey:keys:nonce:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/httpwalletprovider\/keyattestation(instancekey:keys:nonce:)","abstract